FITBUDDY – AI FITNESS PLAN GENERATOR USING GEMINI MODELS

PHASE 2: REQUIREMENT ANALYSIS

1. INTRODUCTION

FitBuddy is an AI-powered fitness plan generator that uses
Google Gemini models to create personalized fitness plans
based on user-provided fitness information.

2. PROBLEM STATEMENT

Many users find it difficult to create a suitable workout
routine according to their fitness goals, experience level
and available time. FitBuddy aims to provide an easy way
to generate a personalized fitness plan using Generative AI.

3. OBJECTIVES

• Collect fitness details from users.
• Understand the user's fitness goal.
• Generate personalized workout plans using Gemini.
• Provide exercise recommendations.
• Provide general nutrition suggestions.
• Make the system simple and easy to use.

4. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

The system should:

• Allow users to enter their fitness information.
• Allow users to select their fitness goal.
• Process the user's information.
• Send an appropriate prompt to the Gemini model.
• Generate a personalized fitness plan.
• Display the generated plan clearly.
• Allow users to generate another plan.

5. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

• The application should be easy to use.
• The system should respond within a reasonable time.
• User input should be handled safely.
• The application should provide readable results.
• The system should be reliable and maintainable.

6. INPUTS

• Name
• Age
• Height
• Weight
• Fitness goal
• Activity level
• Fitness experience
• Available workout time

7. OUTPUTS

• Personalized workout plan
• Exercise recommendations
• Weekly schedule
• General nutrition suggestions
• Fitness tips

8. TARGET USERS

• Beginners
• Students
• Fitness enthusiasts
• People starting a fitness routine

9. HARDWARE REQUIREMENTS

• Computer/Laptop
• Internet connection
• Minimum 4 GB RAM recommended

10. SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS

• Web browser
• Code editor
• HTML/CSS/JavaScript
• Google Gemini API
• GitHub

11. EXPECTED OUTCOME

The final system should allow a user to enter their fitness
details and receive a personalized fitness plan generated
using Google Gemini.
